{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    " 呼出方式保持为外部呼出。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " Activation remains set to External Launcher."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 呼出方式保持为外部呼出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · 版本 %@ (%@)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · Version %@ (%@)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · 版本 %@ (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · 菜单搜索": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · Menu Search"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · 菜单搜索"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已保存，切回「内置快捷键」后生效。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ is saved. Switch to Built-in Shortcut to use it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已保存，切回「内置快捷键」后生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已是 macOS 的系统快捷键（系统设置 › 键盘 › 键盘快捷键）。请换一个组合，或先在那里关闭它。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ is a macOS shortcut (System Settings › Keyboard › Keyboard Shortcuts). Choose another shortcut or disable the system shortcut there."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已是 macOS 的系统快捷键（系统设置 › 键盘 › 键盘快捷键）。请换一个组合，或先在那里关闭它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已注册。在任意 App 里按它即可搜索该 App 的菜单。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ is registered. Press it in any app to search that app’s menus."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已注册。在任意 App 里按它即可搜索该 App 的菜单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已被其他 App 占用，未能注册。请换一个组合。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ is in use by another app. Choose a different shortcut."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已被其他 App 占用，未能注册。请换一个组合。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已被其他 App 占用，未能注册；原快捷键保持不变。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ is in use by another app. Your previous shortcut is unchanged."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已被其他 App 占用，未能注册；原快捷键保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已被其他 App 占用，未能注册；呼出方式保持为外部呼出，请先换一个快捷键。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ is in use by another app. Activation remains set to External Launcher. Choose a different shortcut first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已被其他 App 占用，未能注册；呼出方式保持为外部呼出，请先换一个快捷键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 没有可读取的菜单命令。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ has no readable menu commands."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 没有可读取的菜单命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 没有提供可读取的菜单栏。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ does not provide a readable menu bar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 没有提供可读取的菜单栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 设置": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ Settings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@（%lld / %lld 条）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · Commands: %lld / %lld"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@（%lld / %lld 条）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@（%lld 条）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · Commands: %lld"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@（%lld 条）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@：其他工具也可以运行它来呼出，同一个面板。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@: other tools can run this command to open the same panel."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@：其他工具也可以运行它来呼出，同一个面板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@：把它绑到你的键位工具上。MenuSearch 不会改动那些工具的配置。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@: assign this command in your shortcut tool. MenuSearch does not change that tool’s settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@：把它绑到你的键位工具上。MenuSearch 不会改动那些工具的配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 没有执行这个命令（%d）。请刷新后重试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app couldn’t run this command (%d). Refresh to try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 没有执行这个命令（%d）。请刷新后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac App Store 版使用内置快捷键呼出。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The App Store edition uses the built-in shortcut."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac App Store 版使用内置快捷键呼出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MenuSearch 保持运行并自己注册下面的快捷键，在程序坞、⌘Tab 和菜单栏里都能看到它。关掉这个窗口后仍可呼出，直到你退出它。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MenuSearch stays running with the shortcut below and appears in the Dock, ⌘Tab, and menu bar. The shortcut works after you close Settings, until you quit MenuSearch."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MenuSearch 保持运行并自己注册下面的快捷键，在程序坞、⌘Tab 和菜单栏里都能看到它。关掉这个窗口后仍可呼出，直到你退出它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MenuSearch 还没有辅助功能权限。请在「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 辅助功能」中允许 MenuSearch，再重新呼出。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MenuSearch needs Accessibility permission. Enable MenuSearch in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Accessibility, then open the panel again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MenuSearch 还没有辅助功能权限。请在「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 辅助功能」中允许 MenuSearch，再重新呼出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "skhd 也绑定了 %@（%@）。两边会抢同一个键，通常是 skhd 先拿走、这里收不到。可以改用「外部呼出」并让 skhd 运行 menusearch show，或换一个组合。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "skhd also uses %@ (%@) and usually intercepts it first. Choose External Launcher and have skhd run menusearch show, or choose a different shortcut."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "skhd 也绑定了 %@（%@）。两边会抢同一个键，通常是 skhd 先拿走、这里收不到。可以改用「外部呼出」并让 skhd 运行 menusearch show，或换一个组合。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不可用": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unavailable"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不是有效的设置文件": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not a valid settings file"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不是有效的设置文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "也可以从程序坞、菜单栏图标或 ⌘Q 退出。退出后快捷键不再响应，直到再次打开 MenuSearch。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can also quit from the Dock, the menu bar, or with ⌘Q. The shortcut stops working until you open MenuSearch again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也可以从程序坞、菜单栏图标或 ⌘Q 退出。退出后快捷键不再响应，直到再次打开 MenuSearch。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅搜索 %@ 的菜单": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Searching %@ menus only"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅搜索 %@ 的菜单"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用 iCloud 记住配置": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync Settings with iCloud"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 iCloud 记住配置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用系统 Apple 账户同步快捷键配置。辅助功能权限和登录项保留在本机。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync shortcut settings using your Apple Account. Accessibility permission and login settings stay on this Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用系统 Apple 账户同步快捷键配置。辅助功能权限和登录项保留在本机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
