    "呼出方式只能是 builtin 或 external。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activation must be builtin or external."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "呼出方式只能是 builtin 或 external。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "呼出方式无效": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invalid activation mode"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "呼出方式无效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在任意 App 里按下快捷键，列出它菜单栏和各级子菜单里的全部命令；输入即过滤，↑↓ 选择，回车执行，Esc 关闭。菜单内容只在本机读取，不保存、不上传。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press the shortcut in any app to list its menu commands, including submenus. Type to filter, use ↑↓ to select, Return to run, and Esc to close. Menus are read on this Mac and are never saved or uploaded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任意 App 里按下快捷键，列出它菜单栏和各级子菜单里的全部命令；输入即过滤，↑↓ 选择，回车执行，Esc 关闭。菜单内容只在本机读取，不保存、不上传。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "外部呼出": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "External Launcher"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外部呼出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "外部呼出命令": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Launcher Command"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外部呼出命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "外部呼出方式下 MenuSearch 不常驻，不需要登录时启动。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With an external launcher, MenuSearch runs on demand and does not need to launch at login."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外部呼出方式下 MenuSearch 不常驻，不需要登录时启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "外部呼出方式下不常驻，不需要登录时启动。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With an external launcher, MenuSearch runs on demand and does not need to launch at login."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外部呼出方式下不常驻，不需要登录时启动。"
          }
